00:27:25.340 --> 00:27:26.740
onime što je radila

686
00:27:26.740 --> 00:27:27.060
i pre.

687
00:27:27.060 --> 00:27:29.080
Pre početka pandemije

688
00:27:29.080 --> 00:27:30.980
sam ja bila

689
00:27:30.980 --> 00:27:32.460
na nekoj degustaciji vina.

690
00:27:32.460 --> 00:27:33.760
Ne znam ništa

691
00:27:33.760 --> 00:27:34.260
o vinima,

692
00:27:34.260 --> 00:27:35.020
ja pijem pivo,

693
00:27:35.020 --> 00:27:35.800
ali, kao,

694
00:27:35.800 --> 00:27:36.680
hajde da naučimo.

695
00:27:36.680 --> 00:27:37.640
Pa te neko nešto uči,

696
00:27:37.640 --> 00:27:38.640
to sad traje satima,

697
00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:39.920
i neko ti tako nešto priča,

698
00:27:39.920 --> 00:27:40.940
i

699
00:27:41.720 --> 00:27:42.940
uz sve ta

700
00:27:42.940 --> 00:27:44.100
silna školovanja

701
00:27:44.100 --> 00:27:45.020
tih somelijera,

702
00:27:45.020 --> 00:27:46.860
sva njihova životna iskustva

703
00:27:46.860 --> 00:27:47.620
i to da, kao, znam

704
00:27:47.620 --> 00:27:48.460
tačno koje grožđe

705
00:27:48.460 --> 00:27:49.680
odakle dolazi,

706
00:27:50.440 --> 00:27:52.500
moja glavna lekcija je bila,

707
00:27:52.500 --> 00:27:53.640
koju sam tada naučila,

708
00:27:53.640 --> 00:27:54.800
evo sad vam je prenosim:

709
00:27:55.780 --> 00:27:56.740
nije bitno

710
00:27:56.740 --> 00:27:57.720
da li ti uparuješ

711
00:27:57.720 --> 00:27:59.000
to vino sa tom hranom

712
00:27:59.000 --> 00:28:00.040
jer to tako treba.

713
00:28:00.040 --> 00:28:01.800
Ako ti se pije to vino,

714
00:28:01.800 --> 00:28:02.920
ako ti se sviđa,

715
00:28:02.920 --> 00:28:04.220
onda kršiš pravila

716
00:28:04.220 --> 00:28:04.840
i onda kažeš:

717
00:28:04.840 --> 00:28:05.740
da, ja ću da pijem,

718
00:28:05.740 --> 00:28:06.520
ne znam,

719
00:28:06.520 --> 00:28:08.140
belo vino sa crvenim mesom.

720
00:28:08.860 --> 00:28:09.620
Ja ne znam,

721
00:28:09.620 --> 00:28:10.740
i dalje nisam ništa naučila

722
00:28:10.740 --> 00:28:11.220
o vinima,

723
00:28:11.220 --> 00:28:12.160
evidentno je,

724
00:28:12.160 --> 00:28:13.580
ali sam naučila jednu stvar,

725
00:28:13.580 --> 00:28:14.940
a to je da nije bitno

726
00:28:14.940 --> 00:28:16.060
šta nam govore

727
00:28:16.060 --> 00:28:17.100
da treba da radimo,

728
00:28:17.100 --> 00:28:18.580
nego da, ako

729
00:28:18.580 --> 00:28:20.440
nam se dešavaju

730
00:28:20.440 --> 00:28:21.460
ovakve situacije —

731
00:28:21.460 --> 00:28:22.840
a treba da budemo spremni

732
00:28:22.840 --> 00:28:23.340
da ovo nije

733
00:28:23.340 --> 00:28:24.300
poslednji put

734
00:28:24.300 --> 00:28:25.440
kada ćemo se suočavati

735
00:28:25.440 --> 00:28:26.440
sa ovakvim izazovima —

736
00:28:26.440 --> 00:28:28.120
da će biti neophodno

737
00:28:28.120 --> 00:28:29.100
da znamo sebe

738
00:28:29.100 --> 00:28:30.520
i šta je nama potrebno

739
00:28:30.520 --> 00:28:31.160
da bismo mogli

740
00:28:31.160 --> 00:28:32.320
da radimo kvalitetno.

741
00:29:19.840 --> 00:29:21.700
Da možemo da razmislimo

742
00:29:21.700 --> 00:29:22.380
kako možemo

743
00:29:22.380 --> 00:29:23.400
da naš rad

744
00:29:23.400 --> 00:29:24.340
od kuće adaptiramo,

745
00:29:24.340 --> 00:29:24.880
da on bude

746
00:29:24.880 --> 00:29:26.300
ono što je nama potrebno.

747
00:29:29.100 --> 00:29:31.640
I takođe,

748
00:29:31.640 --> 00:29:32.800
ono što je

749
00:29:33.480 --> 00:29:34.120
jedna,

750
00:29:34.120 --> 00:29:35.440
jedna misao

751
00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:35.940
sa kojom želim

752
00:29:35.940 --> 00:29:36.640
da vas ostavim

753
00:29:36.640 --> 00:29:37.000
danas,

754
00:29:37.000 --> 00:29:38.380
jeste da razmislimo,

755
00:29:38.380 --> 00:29:39.720
kada vidimo statistiku,

756
00:29:39.720 --> 00:29:41.080
kada vidimo istraživanje

757
00:29:41.080 --> 00:29:42.600
i kada vidimo neke procente,

758
00:29:42.600 --> 00:29:43.940
šta se krije

759
00:29:43.940 --> 00:29:44.540
iza toga,

760
00:29:44.540 --> 00:29:46.080
gde nas to vodi,

761
00:29:46.080 --> 00:29:46.900
i da li to znači

762
00:29:46.900 --> 00:29:47.100
da

763
00:29:47.800 --> 00:29:49.100
nekome to odgovara,

764
00:29:49.100 --> 00:29:49.980
kome to odgovara,

765
00:29:49.980 --> 00:29:50.500
zašto,

766
00:29:50.500 --> 00:29:51.720
i iznad svega,

767
00:29:51.720 --> 00:29:53.340
šta je to što nama treba.

768
00:29:53.340 --> 00:29:54.380
Tako da pozivam vas

769
00:29:54.380 --> 00:29:54.920
da pijete

770
00:29:54.920 --> 00:29:56.320
vino koje vam se pije,

771
00:29:56.320 --> 00:29:57.600
pivo koje vam se pije,

772
00:29:57.600 --> 00:29:59.040
da radite na način

773
00:29:59.040 --> 00:30:00.120
koji vama odgovara

774
00:30:00.120 --> 00:30:01.200
i da se borite

775
00:30:01.200 --> 00:30:01.620
za to,

776
00:30:01.620 --> 00:30:03.080
da svi budemo odgovorni

777
00:30:03.080 --> 00:30:03.840
jedni prema drugima,

778
00:30:03.840 --> 00:30:04.820
ali da nastavimo

779
00:30:04.820 --> 00:30:06.140
da budemo produktivni

780
00:30:06.140 --> 00:30:07.700
i kreativni.

781
00:30:07.700 --> 00:30:08.660
Hvala vam najlepše.
